// Hβ.emit.under-application-suspension's standing crucible: bare
// under-application (one field absent, no ?? marker) must NEVER
// silently produce a wrong-valued run. Today the emit produces invalid
// WAT (loud at assemble — the 2026-08-09 find); the peer's fix makes
// this program RUN as the suspension, exit 42. Either state is sound;
// the one forbidden state is a run with a wrong value.
fn add3(a, b, c) = a + b + c

fn main() = {
  let mid = add3(10, 30)
  mid(2)
}
